/**
 * seicase sample catalogue — the single source of truth for:
 *   1. supabase/seed.sql            (generated by `npm run db:seed:generate`)
 *   2. placeholder artwork          (generated by `npm run images:generate`)
 *   3. demo mode                    (the storefront renders this data when
 *                                     Supabase env variables are not set yet)
 *
 * Plain TypeScript with no path aliases so Node can run it directly.
 */
